# Clio XRPL API Server — honeycluster/nodekit

Binary: /opt/clio/bin/clio_server
Config: /opt/clio/etc/config.json
Scripts: /opt/clio/scripts/
Logs: /opt/clio/log/

## Useful commands

clio_server --conf /opt/clio/etc/config.json Start Clio manually
curl -sd '{"method":"server_info"}' http://127.0.0.1:51233 | python3 -m json.tool
Check server status
cat /opt/clio/etc/config.json View current config

## Scripts

./scripts/entrypoint.sh Container entrypoint (runs on start)
./scripts/startup.sh Startup logic
./scripts/shutdown.sh Graceful shutdown

## Environment

NETWORK Network to connect to (mainnet, testnet, devnet)
PATH Includes /opt/clio/bin

Documentation: https://github.com/honeycluster/nodekit/blob/develop/docs/clio/
Source: https://github.com/XRPLF/clio
